    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaya kūtūng'wa na SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gwene ntemi Uzia akazumalīkīla, nakamona ū Seeba igashije h'isūmbī lya būtemi, higūlya no, na mu kūgūngūhiwa kūtaale no no no; ī ng'hanjo yakwe yalī yokala pa ū mu hekalu ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya yakwe gaalīho maselafi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maselafi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mbika īmò yaho ya bamalaika ba ng'wa Mulungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " būlī lyene lyalī na manana atandatū: Abīlī gaalī gifīkīgije kū būshū, abīlī hangī gaalī gifīkīgije kū mhambala jago; hama hangī ay'abīlī gaalalīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī lyene lyahamukaga kū bichalyo līlīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlwa nguno ya kūhamuka kw'ilaka lyago, ī ng'hīngī ja ha nyango jatinginaga kūfuma ngw'itina lyajo; nī hekalu īkookala lyochi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nūlīla nalīhaya, “Nashila būlī, naacha! Nguno nalī munhū wa nomo nsoso; hama nakikalaga hamò na banhū ba milomo misoso, alīyo a miso gane gamona ū Ntemi, ū SEEBA wa mabità.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna līmò lya maselafi lyūlala līnizīīlile, līlī n'ikala lya moto mu nkono gwalyo; līkalyīnja ha ng'walīlo lyūlībūūcha n'ibūūkījo lya moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyūshika lyūnikuumya nī likala lyenīlo kū nomo gwane, hūna lyūyomba; “Managa gīkī, īkī ī lyenīlī lyakūkuumya ū nomo gwako, ū būbi wako wīnjiagwa, nī shibi shako shalekejiagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla nigwa ilaka lya g'wa Seeba līlīhaya, “Nantūme nani, nani aje a ha ng'wanya gwise?” Hūna nūshosha, “Nalīho nene aha, nitūmage nene!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūniwīla, jaga ūkabawīle a banhū benaba gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
